obs The live ancestor process confirmed timeout 5400. At 41 minutes 44 seconds of that window, pending guards carried 3028 seconds of prior cost. Completed guards had cost 2370 seconds against 2110 for the same prior readings. These are historical costs and observed durations, not a completion guarantee.
obs I launched despite the already recorded paired-pass estimate and did not reserve opening and send time around the cold cadence cost. That was my scheduling error. I asked about the card's proposed longer window; no answer arrived before this record. The process limit remains unchanged.
obs Sent TERM only to the returned PID through fleet_call --pid after it verified this checkout. Waited for run_verdict=died_unexpectedly exit_code=143 and process exit before edits. The partial transcript reports 158 green, 14 red, and 3 gated results, totaling 2390 guard-seconds. It carries no closing tree_moved reading and earns no full receipt. Full cold and hot proof remains owed.
